   "text": "University Bridge - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity Bridge\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nUBridge is the marriage of the nation’s premier two-year colleges with an educational firm committed to enriching students’ lives through successful college transfers. The unique, tailored academic experience offers guaranteed admissions to top universities in the United States. UBridge’s guaranteed admissions offers stem from articulation agreements between their two-year colleges and a number of elite four-year colleges. The University Bridge program is an all-inclusive academic experience tailored to international students looking to study in the U.S. \nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 06:46\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 06:46\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$30,550.00\nMin: US$25,450.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n0%\n0 of 10,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2013\nCampus(es)\nKentfield, Santa Monica, Irvine, San Mateo, Charlottesville, Seattle\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n07/02/2025\nContract End Date\n06/02/2027\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KW3tYW_dH7c\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
